WEBVTT

00:00:01.056 --> 00:00:03.994
What could you build with Claude in one weekend?

00:00:04.874 --> 00:00:05.716
Come and see.

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:07.300
Two live sessions.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.526
One Saturday, one Sunday.

00:00:10.507 --> 00:00:13.598
On day one, we set Claude up to know your work.

00:00:13.898 --> 00:00:17.409
A context file, so the answers stop being generic.

00:00:17.775 --> 00:00:20.082
A weekly report, in minutes.

00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:24.977
And a workspace where Claude reads your files, and drafts directly.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:29.926
On day two, we automate a task you repeat every week.

00:00:30.226 --> 00:00:33.475
We build a small working app, just by describing it.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.560
And we build your first agent.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:41.087
Give it a goal, and it researches, drafts, and checks its own work.

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:45.062
Everything is built live, step by step.

00:00:45.362 --> 00:00:48.834
Then you get the complete kit, so you can repeat it yourself.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.602
The AI Weekend.

00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:55.787
Live, online, the last weekend of every month.

00:00:56.451 --> 00:00:57.879
Reserve your seat.

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:00.333
The link is on the screen.
